{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q22082929","formula":"C₁₆H₂₀N₄O₂","hill":"C16H20N4O2","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":16.0,"H":20.0,"N":4.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"Bia-10-2474","ru":"BIA 10-2474"},"descriptions":{"en":"BIA 10-2474 is an experimental fatty-acid amide hydrolase (FAAH) inhibitor developed by the Portuguese pharmaceutical company Bial-Portela & Ca. SA. It interacts with the human endocannabinoid system. The drug was in development for the treatment of a range of different medical conditions from anxiety disorder to Parkinson's disease, also for the treatment of chronic pain of multiple sclerosis, cancer, hypertension, or the treatment of obesity.","ru":"BIA 10-2474 — экспериментальный ингибитор гидролазы амидов жирных кислот, разрабатываемый португальской фармацевтической компанией Bial-Portela & Ca. SA. Лекарственный препарат разрабатывается для лечения боли, коррекции настроения и тревожных расстройств, а также двигательных нарушений при нейродегенеративных заболеваниях. Влияет на эндоканнабиноидную систему человека."},"fame":4,"pubchemCid":46831476,"mass":300.36,"charge":0,"smiles":"CN(C1CCCCC1)C(=O)N2C=C(N=C2)C3=C[N+](=CC=C3)[O-]","inchikey":"DOWVMJFBDGWVML-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"N-cyclohexyl-N-methyl-4-(1-oxidopyridin-1-ium-3-yl)imidazole-1-carboxamide","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"46831476","atoms":42,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":2.051,"y":2.239,"z":-0.618,"el":"O"},{"x":-6.655,"y":0.357,"z":-0.538,"el":"O"},{"x":2.25,"y":-0.025,"z":-0.041,"el":"N"},{"x":0.183,"y":1.135,"z":-0.029,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.873,"y":1.949,"z":0.379,"el":"N"},{"x":-5.56,"y":-0.22,"z":-0.238,"el":"N"},{"x":3.668,"y":-0.053,"z":-0.302,"el":"C"},{"x":4.457,"y":0.35,"z":0.947,"el":"C"},{"x":4.093,"y":-1.434,"z":-0.808,"el":"C"},{"x":5.963,"y":